    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan argues that Shang Clan City is the place to go to buy matching Gu, because the worms they have now do not complement each other. Bai Ning Bing agrees. The ice and water series she had while she still possessed Northern Dark Ice Soul physique included ice blade Gu, icicle Gu, water shield Gu, blue bird ice coffin Gu, ice muscles Gu, and frost demon Gu. Those worms complemented each other when paired.",
        "chapters": [
          230
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ice-and-water-series",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_shang_clan_city",
          "gu_icicle_gu",
          "gu_water_shield_gu",
          "gu_blue_bird_ice_coffin_gu",
          "gu_ice_muscles_gu",
          "gu_frost_demon_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "appearance": {
    "claims": [],
    "visual_confidence": "unknown"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In the duel with Gu Yue Qing Shu, ice blades that grow blunt sharpen again under Ice Blade Gu’s power. Bai Ning Bing creates more ice blades and rotates faster to keep the storm up against Qing Shu’s grip.",
        "chapters": [
          141
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When vines pin him, he pours remaining primeval essence into Ice Blade Gu and forms a new ice blade, then cuts free and defends with it.",
        "chapters": [
          142
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Against Fang Yuan, Chainsaw Golden Centipede cuts the iceblade apart. Bai Ning Bing lets go and retreats nearly two meters, then injects primeval essence into iceblade Gu and remakes blades until numerous ones break and he stops matching Fang Yuan head on.",
        "chapters": [
          166
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_chainsaw_golden_centipede"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After they charge out of the thick smoke together, both turn on each other at once. Bai Ning Bing activates Iceblade Gu while Fang Yuan activates Chainsaw Golden Centipede. The iceblade cuts a wound on the centipede, then breaks.",
        "chapters": [
          169
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "On the Shang Clan City battle stage against Yan Tu, Bai Ning Bing runs Ice Edge Gu with Ice Crystal Gu, Swirl Gu, and Tornado Gu while reforming ice blade storm. The power of that storm has jumped to a whole new level, an improved killer move rather than a discarded one.",
        "chapters": [
          314
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "battle-stage-storm",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_yan_tu",
          "gu_ice_crystal_gu",
          "gu_tornado_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
