    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In Shang Clan City she lists Ice Edge Gu in the ice set she weighs against Fang Yuan. Ice blade storm is her self created killer move, formed as an icy tornado by revolving Gu with whirlwind Gu and ice blade Gu. That version can bully rank two, but is substandard in the rank three realm.",
        "chapters": [
          299
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
